{"kind":"propose","text":"Adopt the durable-append batching design at exact pushed head b8e6bbe4b5cd9ba0d8cdf50fc65959993516baf2. It uses one Git-owned non-delta payload-object ingestion and one bounded verified read session, with measured baselines of 15 warm and 24 cold Git launches and acceptance ceilings of 8 and 14 respectively. It preserves signed actor intent, sequencer signing and verification, exact replay, post-dedup admission at the CAS head, authoritative ref atomicity, independent checkpoint publication, and Git-owned durability. This decision authorizes no implementation until ratified and followed by a separate implementation request."}